---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import BreadcrumbSchema from "../components/schema/BreadcrumbSchema.astro";
const breadcrumbs = [
    { name: "Home", url: "https://enclavetools.com" },
    { name: "Privacy Policy" },
];
---

<Layout
    site="Enclavetools"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    tagline="How we handle your data and respect your privacy"
    eyebrow="Last Updated: June 4, 2026"
    pageTitle="Privacy Policy"
    pageDescription="Privacy Policy for Enclavetools - AI tools directory."
    showHero={true}
>
    <BreadcrumbSchema items={breadcrumbs} />

    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-16">
        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-900 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-[4px_4px_0_0_rgba(17,24,39,1)]">

            <article class="prose prose-gray max-w-none text-gray-700">
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    At Enclavetools, accessible from
                    https://enclavetools.com, one of our main priorities is the
                    privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document
                    contains types of information that is collected and recorded
                    by Enclavetools and how we use it.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase">1. Data Collection</h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    Enclavetools is a static website designed to provide
                    information about AI tools. We do not require user
                    registration and do not collect any personally identifiable
                    information (PII) directly from you unless you choose to
                    contact us through external channels (e.g., GitHub or Social
                    Media).
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase">
                    2. Local Storage (Bookmarks)
                </h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    Our "Saved Tools" feature uses your browser's <strong
                        class="text-gray-900 font-black">localStorage</strong> to store the IDs of tools you have bookmarked. This data is
                    stored locally on your device and is never sent to our servers.
                    You can clear this data at any time by clearing your browser's
                    cache or using the "Remove" option in the UI.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase">3. Analytics</h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors interact
                    with our website. Google Analytics uses cookies to track
                    anonymized data (e.g., pages visited, session duration).
                    This helps us improve the user experience. You can opt-out
                    by installing the Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase">4. Cookies</h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    Like most modern websites, we use cookies to optimize your
                    experience. Cookies are small text files stored on your
                    device that help us remember your preferences (like theme
                    settings) and analyze traffic patterns.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase">5. Third-Party Links</h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    Our directory provides links to many external AI tools. We
                    do not control and are not responsible for the privacy
                    practices or content of these third-party sites. We
                    encourage you to review their policies separately.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase">6. Consent</h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    By using our website, you hereby consent to our Privacy
                    Policy and agree to its terms.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase">7. Contact</h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    If you have questions about our privacy practices, feel free
                    to reach out to @planetabhi on social media or via our
                    GitHub repository.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
